{
 "_readme": "Source of truth for the mobile icon set. Run `npm ci && npm run generate` in scripts/icons after editing. Sizes are the SVG width/height in dp; groups are the IconPark colour slots (outer stroke, external fill, internal outline, internal fill) for Multicolor, or the single colour for linear. Material entries are tinted with `fill`. Not generated: the vendor sign-in marks, the splash gradient, the monochrome Android notification icon, the bottom-nav tab icons, icon_chatbot.svg, which is the 240dp chat launcher illustration rather than an icon, and the two icon_caret_down files, a bespoke 18x9 filled triangle matched to the filter chips that no square glyph reproduces.",
